#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:1 b997fcb0ed6f47d1b24ed62451957159
msgid "常见问题与故障排查"
msgstr "FAQ and troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:3 88240b45449b49a89dba25a686f85512
msgid "先按你看到的现象定位。每一项只给最短检查路径；需要完整参数时进入链接页面。"
msgstr ""
"Start with the symptom you see. Each item gives the shortest inspection "
"path; follow the linked page when you need the complete parameter "
"reference."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:5 47d1366686e5417d9efce87a4cdeb796
msgid "安装和启动"
msgstr "Installation and launch"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:7 bc326bc12d164a02a6ad86a9156f1099
msgid "`nepkit` 启动后立即报错"
msgstr "`nepkit` fails immediately after launch"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:9 f32e38cfdec8456692e7c2d246b69f26
msgid "确认当前终端已激活安装 NepTrainKit 的环境。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm that the current terminal has activated the environment where "
"NepTrainKit is installed."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:10
#: 6443621cf57944f5b2c97529f197483d
msgid ""
"运行 `python -c \"import NepTrainKit; "
"print(NepTrainKit.__file__)\"`，确认导入来自预期环境。"
msgstr ""
"Run `python -c \"import NepTrainKit; print(NepTrainKit.__file__)\"` and "
"confirm that the import comes from the expected environment."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:11
#: 5433d6c420e046da8def60a12f060be8
msgid "如果 traceback 指向某个缺失模块，重新核对安装是否完整，不要在多个环境间单独复制包文件。"
msgstr ""
"If the traceback points to a missing module, verify that the installation"
" is complete; do not copy package files between environments."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:12
#: 2401c07785e74486928cb08c3444da96
msgid "如果是 macOS Dock 图标提示但主窗口仍能打开，应保留完整 traceback 判断是否只是图标初始化失败。"
msgstr ""
"If macOS reports a Dock-icon warning while the main window opens, keep "
"the full traceback to determine whether only icon initialization failed."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:14
#: 25c4d764b7ea475c94e5b33dc87d3f23
msgid "安装和运行时检查见[快速开始](../quickstart.md)。"
msgstr "See [Quick start](../quickstart.md) for installation and runtime checks."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:16
#: 936db7c4df434ba891aaab98c747d1d6
msgid "CUDA 不可用或自动回退到 CPU"
msgstr "CUDA unavailable or automatically falling back to CPU"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:18
#: fdc587e060644865bd80a9cc8730bdb3
msgid "先运行："
msgstr "Run first:"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:20
#: cb134e9152374c1e922d0fb19f3b2ef7
msgid ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"
msgstr ""
"python -c \"import nep_adapters as n; print(n.backend_status('cpu')); "
"print(n.backend_status('cuda'))\"\n"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:24
#: 6143b65bc0464423b9ef1c2a36d20888
msgid ""
"`Auto` 会使用可用后端并说明 CUDA 不可用原因。只有必须使用 GPU 时才在设置中强制选 "
"`CUDA`；强制选择但运行时不可用会明确失败。详细入口见[设置](../module/settings.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`Auto` uses an available backend and reports why CUDA is unavailable. "
"Force `CUDA` in Settings only when GPU execution is required; an "
"unavailable forced backend fails explicitly. See "
"[Settings](../module/settings.md) for details."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:27
#: a2eebeda1b5c478ba013e690bc07d062
msgid "导入和显示"
msgstr "Import and display"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:29
#: ce06392d85ab4511a84c29d38e42db50
msgid "`.xyz` / `.extxyz` 导入失败"
msgstr "`.xyz` / `.extxyz` import fails"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:31
#: aa34539712264de0831be65bad9b1f94
msgid "依次检查首帧："
msgstr "Check the first frame in order:"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:33
#: a5b607285c824d219751ac6c01fd0fe7
msgid "声明的原子数是否等于实际原子行数；"
msgstr "Does the declared atom count equal the actual number of atom rows?"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:34
#: 1d426cad68094fb4bb37d6efc6919ce8
msgid "`Properties` 声明的列数是否与每行一致；"
msgstr "Does the number of columns declared by `Properties` match every row?"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:35
#: 5f3c65505574493daffed1f74a320262
msgid "元素符号是否合法；"
msgstr "Are the element symbols valid?"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:36
#: 8b67a0d69d484244b613f45709b55627
msgid "周期结构的 `Lattice` 是否有效；"
msgstr "Is `Lattice` valid for a periodic structure?"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:37
#: ce5048d90e3f437890a466d8f828445b
msgid "`pbc` 是否符合全周期、全非周期或部分周期的真实设置。"
msgstr ""
"Does `pbc` reflect the actual fully periodic, non-periodic, or partially "
"periodic setup?"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:39
#: e3000dbd83714ecabc07a3a14f170d87
msgid "不要通过补零、伪元素或只改扩展名绕过错误。各格式的完整格式要求见[支持格式](../formats.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Do not bypass errors by padding values, inventing elements, or merely "
"changing the extension. See [Supported formats](../formats.md) for the "
"complete format requirements."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:41
#: 5e12f729ed924423982f6febdb14d646
msgid "LAMMPS dump 提示缺少元素映射"
msgstr "LAMMPS dump: missing element mapping"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:43
#: b67acaf4e872477b9691bc5661c59cf5
msgid ""
"只有数值 `type` 的 dump 不能自动知道真实元素。导入时提供完整的“类型编号 → 元素”映射， 或者在 dump 中直接写出 "
"`element` 列。坐标还必须完整使用 `xs/ys/zs`、`x/y/z` 或 `xu/yu/zu` 中的一组。"
msgstr ""
"A dump containing only numeric `type` values cannot identify the actual "
"elements. Provide a complete type-to-element mapping during import, or "
"include an `element` column in the dump. Coordinates must also use one "
"complete set: `xs/ys/zs`, `x/y/z`, or `xu/yu/zu`."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:47
#: 0894ee65aca5474ab37b375248b5f8c3
msgid "打开结构后没有能量、力或 virial 图"
msgstr "No energy, force, or virial plot after opening a structure"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:49
#: 4d333b65b6504a1f83df0c00b594d1e0
msgid "结构坐标可以正常显示，不代表文件中一定有标签。检查是否同时提供了："
msgstr ""
"Coordinates can display normally even when a file has no labels. Check "
"that you provided:"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:51
#: 8c527a0d237146b08608219bf123720d
msgid "EXTXYZ 中的参考能量、力或 virial；"
msgstr "Reference energy, forces, or virial in EXTXYZ;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:52
#: 7c87048e973542519fc6ae67c1f3944c
msgid "对应的 GPUMD 输出文件；或"
msgstr "The corresponding GPUMD output file; or"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:53
#: 471ab3647f8b4ac8b70dab4fe7969458
msgid "可用于现场预测的 `nep.txt`。"
msgstr "A `nep.txt` that can be used for on-the-fly prediction."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:55
#: e3620a9a2b0f4b1da9b1a8b4e64e9ce6
msgid "数据入口和组合方式见[打开数据与切换模型](../module/nep-display-open-data.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Open data and switch models](../module/nep-display-open-data.md) for"
" data entry and combination rules."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:57
#: 8f259829437e4913aa840b8468581a40
msgid "图上的 x、y 哪个是 DFT"
msgstr "Which plot axis is DFT, x or y"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:59
#: ac5bdfe476bc4435ad6d2a5421352f56
#
msgid ""
"NepTrainKit 当前 NEP 对比图中，**x 轴是参考值（通常为 DFT），y 轴是 NEP 预测值**。 NEP "
"与其他工具的输出列顺序不同，不影响本页面坐标约定。仍不确定时直接看坐标轴标题， 不要靠点云方向或文件列顺序猜测。"
msgstr "In NepTrainKit NEP comparison plots, **the x-axis is the reference value (usually DFT) and the y-axis is the NEP prediction**. Different output-column orders in NEP and other tools do not change this convention. If unsure, read the axis titles instead of guessing from point-cloud orientation or file-column order."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:63
#: ed277d20e91c4093a1e0e0868ac2a540
msgid "构建数据集"
msgstr "Make Dataset"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:65
#: 0b41e01c77db473dbf89f4f074a9bb30
msgid "点击运行后没有输出"
msgstr "No output after clicking Run"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:67
#: a02ecf3f8c1246fc938c2c019e4a1da9
msgid "按顺序检查："
msgstr "Check these items in order:"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:69
#: 97351c5380c94910952d423effc77252
msgid "卡片是否已勾选；"
msgstr "Whether the card is selected;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:70
#: 2dcb92be1bd3466f872196dd103f5244
msgid "需要输入的卡片是否已经导入结构；"
msgstr "Whether cards that require input have imported structures;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:71
#: a013bfc3b9d346d68afb81c0d5b01b98
msgid "参数范围是否真的产生采样点，例如起点、终点和步长是否一致；"
msgstr ""
"Whether the parameter range produces sample points, for example, whether "
"the start, end, and step are consistent;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:72
#: 2ec29108208b4d25a6fa4611224c125b
msgid "过滤卡是否把全部结构排除；"
msgstr "Whether a filter card excluded every structure;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:73
#: bbb19f662b234c5992127d84ef6389f6
msgid "状态提示是否说明输入前提、路径、元素或几何条件不满足。"
msgstr ""
"Whether the status message reports an unmet input, path, element, or "
"geometry requirement."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:75
#: 56f060a0fce545088461419b0698b9eb
msgid ""
"进入[卡片选择页](../module/make-dataset-cards/index.md)后打开具体卡片，查看“操作示例”和 "
"“常见问题”。不要只反复点击运行。"
msgstr ""
"Open a specific card from the [card selection page](../module/make-"
"dataset-cards/index.md) and read its “Example workflow” and “Common "
"questions”. Do not simply click Run repeatedly."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:78
#: dfc2794659234bacbede9fa4c67dc7a3
msgid "输出数量比预计少"
msgstr "Fewer outputs than expected"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:80
#: 6a201f8d651f4c11a3d28ba49fe74ee7
msgid ""
"常见原因包括：重复结果被去重、几何检查拒绝候选、距离阈值提前停止、随机尝试达到上限， "
"或输入结构本身没有足够可操作位点。具体数量规则以卡片页的功能说明和参数说明为准。"
msgstr ""
"Common causes include deduplication, geometry rejection, an early "
"distance-threshold stop, the random-attempt limit, or too few operable "
"sites in the input. See the card page's description and parameters for "
"exact counts."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:83
#: 7920b392336a4ac48e6130c459ab141f
msgid "输出数量突然非常大"
msgstr "A sudden explosion in output count"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:85
#: 99023db18a6144cbb8ead2b4cde03aa5
msgid ""
"多轴扫描、多元素组合、多个输入结构和多张卡片都可能相乘。先用单个输入和小范围预览， "
"再逐步增加轴、配比或随机样本数。需要多分支时查看[配方示例](../module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md)， "
"不要一次把所有组合都送入 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"Multiple axes, element combinations, input structures, and cards can "
"multiply the output. Start with one input and a small preview, then "
"increase axes, compositions, or random samples gradually. For branching, "
"see [Recipe examples](../module/make-dataset-cards/recipes.md) instead of"
" sending every combination to DFT at once."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:89
#: df662488b5a244ada15d42a0b9e20488
msgid "界面是中文，文档里为什么还出现英文"
msgstr "Why does the documentation contain English when the interface is Chinese?"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:91
#: 18aa551f1d4841f3abc780d353afee96
msgid ""
"文档采用“中文用途（英文界面名／序列化名）”的方式：中文用于阅读，英文用于和旧 JSON、 "
"代码字段或未翻译界面精确对应。参数标题先写中文标签，括号中保留稳定字段名。"
msgstr ""
"The documentation uses “Chinese purpose (English UI or serialized name)”:"
" Chinese keeps the prose readable, while English preserves exact matches "
"to legacy JSON, code fields, or untranslated UI labels. Parameter "
"headings use Chinese labels first and retain stable field names in "
"parentheses."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:94
#: 357de32a193d476a95f247c54df07972
msgid "筛选、采样和数据修改"
msgstr "Filtering, sampling, and data changes"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:96
#: e068116f967341d28dd9c9b675ee1db2
msgid "FPS 选择数远少于目标"
msgstr "FPS selects far fewer structures than requested"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:98
#: 639a35917118469ba6c6e24bbf8de5b6
msgid ""
"最小距离或 $R^2$ 阈值可能提前停止；也可能是候选池本身高度重复。降低阈值或关闭距离停止， 并检查实际停止原因。FPS "
"只能从已有候选中选择，不会补出缺失的结构类型。详见 [稀疏采样](../module/nep-main-tool-sparse-"
"samples.md)。"
msgstr ""
"A minimum-distance or $R^2$ threshold may stop the process early, or the "
"candidate pool may be highly redundant. Lower the threshold or disable "
"distance stopping, then inspect the actual stop reason. FPS selects only "
"from existing candidates; it cannot invent missing structure types. See "
"[Sparse samples](../module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md)."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:102
#: 24e7191577694299809c361f62db91c1
msgid "FPS 选出的结构仍然不合理"
msgstr "FPS-selected structures are still unreasonable"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:104
#: 284e5b96b50c4b19999008cc76ad5009
msgid ""
"FPS 只看描述符空间距离，短键或坏晶胞反而可能因为“很不一样”而被选中。先执行几何和人工清洗， "
"再做代表性采样。完整顺序见[候选结构清洗](../workflows/clean-candidate-structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"FPS considers only descriptor-space distance, so a short bond or bad cell"
" may be selected because it looks very different. Clean geometrically and"
" manually first, then perform representative sampling. See the full order"
" in [Clean candidate structures](../workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md)."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:107
#: 9a9c8def8dd841babe1089bd411b739e
msgid "能量平移后找不到原始能量"
msgstr "Original energy cannot be found after shifting"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:109
#: 8f721c2e15f546958b1675d72e519f0f
msgid ""
"第一次平移前的结构总能量写入 `energy_original`，新值写在 `energy`。导出 EXTXYZ 后检查这两个 "
"帧级字段。再次平移不会覆盖已经保存的 `energy_original`。详见 [能量基线平移](../module/nep-main-tool-"
"energy-shift.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Before the first shift, the structure's total energy is saved in "
"`energy_original`, and the shifted value is written to `energy`. After "
"exporting EXTXYZ, check both frame fields. A later shift does not "
"overwrite the existing `energy_original`. See [Energy baseline "
"shift](../module/nep-main-tool-energy-shift.md)."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:113
#: 5efac05b0237402e811adda7362b80f1
msgid "最大误差选中的结构数和点数不一致"
msgstr ""
"The number of structures selected by maximum error differs from the "
"number of points"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:115
#: 2a655dc260fd4ba3bc0a27318bde01cf
msgid "能量图通常一行对应一个结构；力图中一个结构有多个原子和分量。最大误差工具会把行映射回 结构编号并去重，所以最终结构数可以少于图上的候选点数。"
msgstr ""
"An energy plot usually has one point per structure, while a force plot "
"has multiple atoms and components per structure. The maximum-error tool "
"maps rows back to structure IDs and deduplicates them, so the final "
"structure count can be lower than the number of plotted candidates."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:118
#: 9a47c71d303a4b3fa98720926582bfcf
msgid "训练集评估"
msgstr "Training Set Audit"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:120
#: 353a077814244fe5949bf05c779fdb4a
msgid "页面显示“没有磁性数据”"
msgstr "The page says “No magnetic data”"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:122
#: 15968c286e6441fc8e774f630c855ae5
msgid ""
"磁性评估只读取有效的逐原子 `spin:R:3`。`mforce`、`force_mag` 或标量说明文字不能代替 三分量自旋字段。先在 "
"EXTXYZ 的 `Properties` 和原子列中确认字段真实存在。"
msgstr ""
"Magnetic assessment reads only a valid per-atom `spin:R:3` field. "
"`mforce`, `force_mag`, and scalar notes cannot replace the three-"
"component spin field. Confirm the field in EXTXYZ `Properties` and atom "
"columns."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:125
#: 554edca2091c45acb4e50ef514e6894e
msgid "结构相或磁类型和预期不同"
msgstr "The structural phase or magnetic type differs from expectation"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:127
#: fe027ebb29b243c7919496b700f17778
msgid ""
"评估结果是当前阈值和有限结构快照下的证据分类。先检查晶胞、周期边界、元素、邻居环境和 自旋字段，再进入[结构相判据](../module"
"/training-audit-phase.md)或 [磁类型判据](../module/training-audit-"
"magnetism.md)。不要把分类名称直接当成热力学相结论。"
msgstr ""
"The assessment is an evidence-based classification for the current "
"thresholds and finite snapshots. Check the cell, periodic boundaries, "
"elements, neighbor environments, and spin fields first, then consult "
"[phase criteria](../module/training-audit-phase.md) or [magnetic-type "
"criteria](../module/training-audit-magnetism.md). Do not treat a "
"classification name as a thermodynamic phase conclusion."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:131
#: 9277bce7ef354e7bb2c8c83e16750795
msgid "仍然无法定位"
msgstr "Still cannot identify the cause"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:133
#: c71ee471e93046ee9535803063060cee
msgid "保留以下信息再反馈问题："
msgstr "Keep the following information when reporting the problem:"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:135
#: fe228c6571b54d1a8c095e06126da83a
msgid "NepTrainKit 版本和操作系统；"
msgstr "NepTrainKit version and operating system;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:136
#: 257102ba60e146e7945c189056ea44a0
msgid "完整 traceback 或界面原始错误文本；"
msgstr "The complete traceback or original UI error text;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:137
#: df0c0b9bd4ae4c8781f797a9611a429b
msgid "能复现问题的最小输入；"
msgstr "The smallest input that reproduces the problem;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:138
#: 4a1b8ad0648c4febb2b616fae7bec5e5
msgid "使用的页面、卡片和参数；"
msgstr "The page, card, and parameters used;"

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:139
#: a6543cfb49c54ecb8218ad35041033d5
msgid "预期结果与实际结果。"
msgstr "The expected and actual results."

#: ../../source/reference/troubleshooting.md:141
#: 7e07fa72581242c5a82543e51b5a00fc
msgid "不要只截最后一行错误；根因通常在 traceback 前面的文件、字段或参数信息中。"
msgstr ""
"Do not report only the last error line; the root cause is usually in the "
"file, field, or parameter information earlier in the traceback."
